  "title": "Duke Energy outlines steps to reliably serve record customer demand resulting from extreme winter weather",
  "summary": "Duke Energy has filed requests with the North Carolina Utilities Commission (NCUC) related to fuel and purchased power costs incurred during one of the most extreme winter periods in the past decade – costs driven by record customer energy demand resulting from the cold weather and the utility’s commitment to keep power available and reliable when it is needed most.",
